{"id":478,"name":"froslass","speciesId":478,"dex":478,"form":"normal","generation":4,"types":["ice","ghost"],"stats":{"hp":70,"attack":80,"defense":70,"special-attack":80,"special-defense":70,"speed":110},"abilities":[{"name":"snow-cloak","hidden":false},{"name":"cursed-body","hidden":true}],"height":13,"weight":266,"baseExp":168,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/478.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/478.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/478.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/478.ogg","genus":"Snow Land Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon da Terra da Neve","flavor":[{"version":"diamond","text":"It freezes foes with an icy breath nearly -60 degrees F. What seems to be its body is actually hollow."},{"version":"platinum","text":"It freezes prey by blowing its -58 degrees F breath. It is said to then secretly display its prey."},{"version":"heartgold","text":"Legends in snowy regions say that a woman who was lost on an icy mountain was reborn as FROSLASS."},{"version":"soulsilver","text":"Legends in snowy regions say that a woman who was lost on an icy mountain was reborn as FROSLASS"},{"version":"x","text":"It freezes foes with an icy breath nearly -60 degrees Fahrenheit. What seems to be its body is actually hollow."},{"version":"y","text":"Legends in snowy regions say that a woman who was lost on an icy mountain was reborn as Froslass."},{"version":"sun","text":"When it finds humans or Pokémon it likes, it freezes them and takes them to its chilly den, where they become decorations."},{"version":"moon","text":"The soul of a woman lost on a snowy mountain possessed an icicle, becoming this Pokémon. The food it most relishes is the souls of men."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"It freezes hikers who have come to climb snowy mountains and carries them back to its home. It only goes after men it thinks are handsome."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"It’s said that on nights of terrible blizzards, it comes down to human settlements. If you hear it knocking at your door, do not open it!"},{"version":"sword","text":"After a woman met her end on a snowy mountain, her regrets lingered on. From them, this Pokémon was born. Its favorite food is frozen souls."},{"version":"shield","text":"It spits out cold air of nearly −60 degrees Fahrenheit to freeze its quarry. It brings frozen prey back to its lair and neatly lines them up."},{"version":"legends-arceus","text":"A Pokémon inhabited by the soul of a woman who died bearing a grudge in the snowy mountains. Legends of Froslass placing deathly curses on misbehaving men send shivers down my spine."}],"flavorPt":"Um Pokémon habitado pela alma de uma mulher que morreu guardando rancor nas montanhas nevadas. Lendas de Froslass lançando maldições mortais sobre homens malcomportados causam arrepios na minha espinha.","genderRate":8,"captureRate":75,"eggGroups":["fairy","mineral"],"isLegendary":false,"isMythical":false,"evolution":{"species":"snorunt","speciesId":361,"evolvesTo":[{"conditions":["Nível 42"],"species":"glalie","speciesId":362,"evolvesTo":[]},{"conditions":["Usar Dawn Stone, Fêmea"],"species":"froslass","speciesId":478,"evolvesTo":[]}]},"varieties":[{"id":478,"name":"froslass","form":"normal","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/478.png"},{"id":10285,"name":"froslass-mega","form":"mega","sprite":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/10285.png"}],"games":[8,9,10,11,14,15,16,17,18,20,23,24,25],"moves":[{"id":8,"learn":[[9,"tutor",0],[10,"tutor",0],[14,"tutor",0],[16,"tutor",0],[18,"tutor",0],[20,"tm",0],[25,"tm",0]]},{"id":29,"learn":[[10,"tutor",0],[20,"lv",1],[23,"lv",1],[25,"lv",1]]},{"id":34,"learn":